WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.380
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.640 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.620 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.960 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

01:51.670 --> 01:58.590
<i>It was 33 degrees Celsius at noon today, and last night was 21 degrees Celsius!</i>

01:58.590 --> 02:03.640
<i>For all those who are going out today, please be careful of heat stroke.</i>

02:03.640 --> 02:11.560
<i>Also, from Hodo Studio, a relay report detailing world-wide abnormal weather patterns will be announced...</i>

02:11.560 --> 02:14.190
The hurricane that struck the southern portion of America...

02:14.190 --> 02:19.530
<i>...is responsible for 1300 deaths, and the destruction of more than 1000 homes and buildings.</i>

02:19.530 --> 02:24.410
<i>Next, near Naples, Italy, the volcano of Vesuvius suddenly erupted.</i>

02:24.410 --> 02:28.080
Fin-chan, how can I...you...?

02:29.170 --> 02:31.500
Hello!

02:37.630 --> 02:40.590
Oh, geez! What's with this heat?!

02:40.590 --> 02:43.470
It's the middle of winter, right Access?

02:44.260 --> 02:47.180
Access! What's the matter?! Snap out of it!

02:48.140 --> 02:50.730
F-Fin-chan is...coming!

02:50.730 --> 02:51.980
What?!

02:51.980 --> 02:54.520
What are we going to do, Sinbad?!

02:54.520 --> 02:59.320
What choice do we have? We have to tell Maron the truth.

03:16.670 --> 03:18.380
Jeanne d'Arc...

03:29.520 --> 03:31.100
<i>The verdict has been reached.</i>

03:31.100 --> 03:34.520
<i>The words of God are spoken to the Pope and him alone.</i>

03:34.520 --> 03:40.860
<i>Therefore, Jeanne d'Arc's claim that she received a divine message from God is impossible!</i>

03:40.860 --> 03:44.490
<i>She has received orders from the Devil!</i>

03:44.490 --> 03:50.620
<i>It is a serious crime to claim the Devil's words as God's and defame the Pope's power!</i>

03:52.160 --> 03:56.290
<i>Consequently, Jeanne d'Arc is sentenced to be burned at the stake!</i>

04:32.780 --> 04:34.710
You're earlier than scheduled?

04:35.500 --> 04:38.000
Then, with my own hands...

04:40.880 --> 04:45.430
Reunion with Fin!! Dramatic Nightmare

04:45.430 --> 04:47.090
Maron! Maron!

04:47.090 --> 04:48.640
She's not here...

04:49.430 --> 04:51.350
Maron? No, she's not here.

04:51.350 --> 04:52.390
I see...

04:52.390 --> 04:55.020
Hey, hey! Have you seen the news?!

04:55.020 --> 04:57.060
It's disastrous!

04:57.060 --> 04:58.520
Disastrous?

04:59.070 --> 05:02.690
<i>The surrounding area of the Yellow River in China has flooded.</i>

05:02.690 --> 05:05.700
<i>In Turkey, a 7.0 earthquake has struck...</i>

05:05.700 --> 05:09.070
<i>...and Italy's Vesuvius has erupted.</i>

05:09.070 --> 05:13.950
<i>In the southern island countries, enormous tsunamis have resulted in severe casualties.</i>

05:14.000 --> 05:18.790
See? It's so strange. Until yesterday, everything was just fine...

05:18.790 --> 05:23.260
Also, today is the middle of winter and you just feel the heat! It's the end of the millennium...

05:24.220 --> 05:25.260
Access...

05:25.260 --> 05:27.590
Yeah, it's all because of Fin...

05:27.590 --> 05:28.550
Let's hurry!

05:29.010 --> 05:30.810
Hey, Chiaki!

05:30.890 --> 05:33.930
Momokuri Library

05:40.690 --> 05:44.530
Let's see... Hundred Year War... Jeanne d'Arc...

05:45.360 --> 05:48.030
It should be around here somewhere...

05:48.030 --> 05:49.620
Ah, here it is!

05:49.620 --> 05:50.530
- Kusakabe-san.

05:52.370 --> 05:54.330
Hijiri-sensei.

05:56.120 --> 06:00.000
I see, you're researching Jeanne d'Arc...

06:00.630 --> 06:03.670
There have been lots of things happening lately...

06:03.670 --> 06:08.220
...so I thought if I did some research on Jeanne d'Arc, I might find something.

06:08.220 --> 06:13.310
Reading books won't help you learn about the real Jeanne d'Arc.

06:13.310 --> 06:14.600
Huh?

06:14.600 --> 06:18.520
I did a lot of research on the Hundred Year War on France...

06:18.520 --> 06:21.480
...so would you like me to tell you what I know?

06:21.480 --> 06:23.860
Oh, it wouldn't be any trouble?

06:25.110 --> 06:28.740
As I said before, I can't leave you alone.

06:41.750 --> 06:44.380
Damn! Where did she go?!

06:44.920 --> 06:47.010
Hey, have you seen Maron?!

06:47.010 --> 06:50.510
Come to think of it, I saw her at the Momokuri Library with Shikaido-sensei.

06:50.510 --> 06:52.600
Gotcha! Thank you!

06:53.600 --> 06:55.560
Momokuri Library

07:02.810 --> 07:07.280
Kusakabe-san, could you go ahead to the parking lot?

07:07.280 --> 07:09.190
I forgot something.

07:09.190 --> 07:10.570
Okay.

07:14.740 --> 07:19.080
It's Nagoya-kun. Why are you in such a hurry?

07:19.080 --> 07:20.330
Where's Maron?!

07:20.330 --> 07:23.290
Kusakabe-san? I haven't seen her.

07:23.290 --> 07:28.300
Don't give me that! If you lay a finger on Maron, you'll regret it!

07:28.300 --> 07:31.800
I see. So you have realized it as well.

07:31.800 --> 07:32.840
What?!

07:32.840 --> 07:37.600
Oh, nothing. Shouldn't you be looking for Kusakabe-san?

07:44.400 --> 07:45.940
Evil-Curse-Demon

08:01.160 --> 08:02.750
Sorry to keep you waiting.

08:04.420 --> 08:06.380
Where did you go, Maron?!

08:08.300 --> 08:09.920
What's the matter?

08:09.920 --> 08:11.010
The door won't open!

08:11.010 --> 08:13.470
What? That can't be...

08:13.470 --> 08:14.300
Access!

08:14.300 --> 08:17.010
There's a magic spell on this door!

08:25.900 --> 08:26.480
Maron!

08:33.030 --> 08:34.490
Good. Let's go!

08:39.830 --> 08:41.660
So persistent.

08:46.750 --> 08:48.210
What are these things?!

08:48.840 --> 08:51.010
I knew he was a Demon!

08:51.010 --> 08:52.340
You...!

08:53.300 --> 08:55.300
Maron! Don't go!

08:55.300 --> 08:57.800
Come back! Maron!!!

08:58.350 --> 09:00.180
Is something wrong?

09:00.180 --> 09:02.600
I thought I heard someone calling for me...

09:03.560 --> 09:05.140
It must have been your imagination...

09:17.820 --> 09:20.200
Demon Knight Noin...

09:20.200 --> 09:22.700
I have heard that name before.

09:22.700 --> 09:24.410
Really?!

09:24.410 --> 09:30.130
During the later period of the Hundred Year War, he was a knight who fought under Jeanne d'Arc.

09:30.130 --> 09:34.010
His name was Noin Claude.

09:34.010 --> 09:35.920
Noin Claude...

09:37.010 --> 09:38.930
Will you tell me the details?

09:45.850 --> 09:51.400
In 1430, when confusion had reached its peak in France,

09:51.400 --> 09:54.530
there was a knight assigned to Jeanne d'Arc's battalion.

09:54.530 --> 09:57.700
He fought as Jeanne d'Arc right hand-man.

09:57.700 --> 10:02.200
Soon, he was advising Jeanne d'Arc in both public and private matters.

10:02.200 --> 10:05.200
Why would a man like that become a Demon?

10:06.330 --> 10:10.170
Jeanne d'Arc fought on the battlefield as a man,

10:10.170 --> 10:13.630
but he saw her only as a little girl.

10:14.630 --> 10:18.970
Because he treated her as a real person and not someone extraordinary,

10:18.970 --> 10:22.220
Jeanne d'Arc slowly grew fond of him.

10:22.220 --> 10:27.640
And it was not very long until they became inseparable.

10:27.640 --> 10:31.610
One day, he proposed to Jeanne d'Arc.

10:31.610 --> 10:35.570
However, Jeanne d'Arc rejected his offer firmly.

10:38.200 --> 10:39.450
Why?

10:39.910 --> 10:43.700
"I have a mission given to me by God, which I must complete."

10:43.700 --> 10:47.620
"The mission is to seal the Demon which has possessed the enemy army."

10:47.620 --> 10:49.920
"Until I complete that mission..."

10:49.920 --> 10:50.960
That's...

10:50.960 --> 10:58.010
Yes. Like you, Jeanne d'Arc was also given the mission to seal Demons.

11:00.840 --> 11:03.140
Could that be...?

11:03.140 --> 11:07.600
According to history, she freed France with a sword in her hand,

11:07.600 --> 11:12.310
but it was actually a battle to seal the Demons possessing the enemy.

11:15.360 --> 11:17.400
That's the same as me...

11:17.400 --> 11:20.820
And when he heard this,

11:20.820 --> 11:22.320
he cursed God.

11:22.320 --> 11:23.240
What?!

11:30.410 --> 11:36.300
God said that the only one who could have the power to seal the Demons and protect the world...

11:36.300 --> 11:40.170
...was a woman who devoted everything to Him.

11:41.300 --> 11:43.430
Devote everything to God...!

11:43.430 --> 11:46.050
That meant giving up being a woman!

11:46.050 --> 11:50.310
No, it meant even giving up being a human being!

11:50.310 --> 11:55.980
Emotions of happiness, anger, sadness, pleasure, everything!

11:55.980 --> 11:58.110
He was in torment!

11:58.110 --> 12:01.900
But, with the assumption that this was what she truly desired,

12:01.900 --> 12:07.950
he vowed to stay beside her, to fight with her, and to protect her!

12:07.950 --> 12:13.120
Eventually, France won thanks to her.

12:13.120 --> 12:14.460
However...

12:16.750 --> 12:21.090
What was waiting for Jeanne d'Arc, who had saved France from the Demons,

12:21.090 --> 12:26.550
was a pathetic witch trial and the punishment of being burned at the stake!

12:26.550 --> 12:30.220
He prayed earnestly to God for her salvation.

12:30.220 --> 12:36.400
But God just watched the woman, who had devoted so much to Him, die!

12:41.610 --> 12:45.320
I cannot forgive Him! I will never forgive Him!

12:45.320 --> 12:49.830
She followed the Word of God, gave up everything, and fought valiantly...

12:49.830 --> 12:54.040
...yet God did not save her, even at the very end!

12:54.040 --> 12:58.420
I cursed God and I vowed revenge against God!

13:03.050 --> 13:05.800
With her body in my arms,

13:05.800 --> 13:09.930
I uttered 1000 curses and 10,000 words of reproach to God,

13:09.930 --> 13:16.270
entrusted my soul to the Devil and gained the powers of darkness.

13:19.690 --> 13:23.070
W-Wait a minute. Did you say "I?"

13:23.070 --> 13:24.320
Yes.

13:35.750 --> 13:40.540
I am Noin Claude, Kusakabe Maron.

13:42.880 --> 13:44.970
No, Jeanne!

13:57.440 --> 14:00.400
Geez! There's so many of these things again!

14:01.860 --> 14:03.320
Are you all right, Access?

14:03.320 --> 14:04.940
H-Huh? Yeah...

14:09.910 --> 14:14.120
T-This isn't good! It looks like we don't have any time left!

14:14.120 --> 14:16.960
We're charging in! Are you game?

14:16.960 --> 14:19.290
I can fight, too!

14:19.290 --> 14:22.630
Good! That's my partner! Let's go!

14:22.630 --> 14:23.300
Yeah!

14:35.600 --> 14:38.350
It can't... You're joking, right Sensei?

14:38.350 --> 14:45.320
Don't you remember anything after all that I've told you, Jeanne d'Arc?

14:45.980 --> 14:47.690
What are you saying?

14:52.490 --> 14:54.330
I see, Jeanne...

14:54.700 --> 14:58.830
I knew you were not her reincarnation.

14:58.830 --> 15:00.040
Then...!

15:15.470 --> 15:19.440
Do you know why I approached you?

15:20.390 --> 15:25.230
To take back the soul of Jeanne d'Arc, which sleeps within you!

15:25.230 --> 15:27.400
The soul of Jeanne d'Arc...

15:29.240 --> 15:34.580
Yes. God used Jeanne d'Arc's soul in a reincarnation experiment...

15:37.370 --> 15:40.330
And you were born.

15:41.040 --> 15:42.210
That's a lie!

15:42.210 --> 15:46.500
It's not a lie! Then, why is it that you can transform into Jeanne?!

15:46.500 --> 15:49.840
Why is it that you can seal Demons like her?!

15:49.840 --> 15:51.840
That's a God-given...

15:51.840 --> 15:59.770
Exactly! God used her soul like a toy and is now using you to repeat this senseless act!

15:59.770 --> 16:02.850
But I am not going to let that happen!

16:02.850 --> 16:07.980
That day, that time! I could not forgive God for letting her die!

16:07.980 --> 16:13.570
I am going to take back her soul from that selfish God, and give her peace!

16:13.570 --> 16:18.740
To do that, I entrusted my soul to the Devil and became a Demon Knight!

16:19.910 --> 16:28.090
However, you had God's barrier protecting you, and even I could not get near it!

16:30.340 --> 16:34.300
If I could not break it from the outside, I would break it from the inside.

16:40.350 --> 16:44.060
So I used a fake letter to get you to trust me.

16:44.060 --> 16:48.730
I approached you and I attacked the people around you....

16:51.280 --> 16:54.700
...in order to attack your heart and weaken you!

16:54.700 --> 17:00.410
Then, the people around me getting hurt and Zen-kun dying are...

17:10.340 --> 17:12.090
It's all your fault!

17:17.050 --> 17:18.760
So horrible...

17:18.760 --> 17:20.680
For such a petty reason...

17:20.680 --> 17:23.100
Zen-kun... Zen-kun...

17:24.100 --> 17:29.480
Obviously. My only wish is that you suffer.

17:29.480 --> 17:31.900
I do not care who else suffers!

17:31.900 --> 17:36.360
Do you actually think Jeanne d'Arc would be happy if you do this?!

17:36.360 --> 17:39.830
I bet she trusted God until the very end!

17:39.830 --> 17:43.000
Shut up! What about her would you understand?!

17:43.620 --> 17:48.540
In the end, God did not even save her!

17:48.540 --> 17:52.000
She was killed by a selfish God!

17:54.970 --> 17:59.850
Therefore, killing you, whom God loves, will be revenge against Him!

17:59.850 --> 18:04.770
And her soul will finally rest in peace!

18:06.640 --> 18:11.190
No! It was just that you couldn't completely trust God...

18:13.940 --> 18:16.700
You couldn't completely trust God.

18:16.700 --> 18:20.700
God's power comes from continually believing in Him.

18:23.080 --> 18:24.160
Jeanne...

18:29.370 --> 18:34.880
No! You couldn't be the Jeanne d'Arc that I loved!

18:34.880 --> 18:39.090
It must have been so hard to be separated from the one you love.

18:39.090 --> 18:42.640
To live a life filled with revenge and sadness...

18:42.640 --> 18:44.720
Shut up! Just die!

18:55.030 --> 19:01.410
I may have inherited the soul of Jeanne d'Arc, as you said...

19:01.410 --> 19:05.160
But I... I am Kusakabe Maron!

19:14.710 --> 19:15.800
Maron!

19:15.800 --> 19:16.510
Chiaki!

19:16.510 --> 19:18.050
Are you all right, Maron?

19:18.670 --> 19:19.510
Yes...

19:20.590 --> 19:23.760
I am surprised you made it all this way...

19:23.760 --> 19:25.810
You've finally shown your true self!

19:25.810 --> 19:29.770
My, my. Are you sure you want to take me on?

19:29.770 --> 19:31.140
What was that?!

19:31.140 --> 19:34.980
Don't you have something very important to say to her?

19:36.360 --> 19:37.940
Something very important?

19:38.490 --> 19:43.950
Would you like me to tell her the truth for you?

19:44.450 --> 19:45.910
Truth?

19:46.280 --> 19:50.710
He has been hiding something very important from you.

19:50.710 --> 19:52.750
Shut up! Quiet!

19:52.750 --> 19:58.380
Maron, although you may not believe what I'm going to tell you, I want you to listen to the whole thing.

19:59.590 --> 20:00.760
You see...

20:14.600 --> 20:16.610
Could this be...?!

20:21.610 --> 20:23.240
We've got to get out of this room!

21:05.450 --> 21:06.660
What is that?!

21:08.990 --> 21:10.490
Fin! Fin is...!

21:10.490 --> 21:11.370
She's here!

21:17.580 --> 21:19.000
I'm going to fight!

21:19.000 --> 21:20.090
Wait, Maron!

21:20.090 --> 21:22.170
You have to listen to me first!

21:22.170 --> 21:24.090
<i>Fin, lend me your power!</i>

21:24.090 --> 21:26.760
- <i>Deliver my wish to...!</i>

21:24.670 --> 21:26.760
- No,

21:25.430 --> 21:26.760
I

21:25.970 --> 21:26.760
won't !!!

21:27.800 --> 21:31.810
- Hello! Maron, I'm back!

21:32.720 --> 21:35.730
Fin! Is that you, Fin?! Where are you?!

21:38.150 --> 21:40.230
Right before your eyes.

21:47.200 --> 21:49.410
W-Who are you?

21:49.410 --> 21:52.660
What? You've already forgotten about me?

21:52.660 --> 21:54.160
Could you be...?

21:54.160 --> 21:56.710
Yeah, that's Fin.

21:57.580 --> 21:58.830
Fin-chan...

21:59.880 --> 22:01.960
No way! That's Fin?!

22:03.170 --> 22:05.880
That's right, I'm Fin...

22:05.880 --> 22:07.970
...Fallen Angel Fin Fish!

22:07.970 --> 22:10.470
Fallen Angel Fin...?!

22:28.610 --> 22:35.200
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.000 --> 22:44.630
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.260 --> 22:49.130
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.130 --> 22:52.850
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.010 --> 23:01.980
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.520 --> 23:05.690
Never forgetting...

23:05.980 --> 23:09.820
...there is unending love.

23:10.530 --> 23:14.580
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.780 --> 23:17.870
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.160 --> 23:21.080
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.580 --> 23:26.050
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.250 --> 23:30.090
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.340 --> 23:37.890
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:48.110 --> 23:49.950
Kusakabe Maron.

23:49.950 --> 23:53.780
I have been waiting for you to come here for a long time.

23:53.780 --> 23:54.950
For me?

23:56.330 --> 23:58.910
Are you...?! Jeanne d'Arc?!

23:58.910 --> 24:01.120
Maron, be courageous.

24:01.120 --> 24:04.170
Do not make the same mistake I did.

24:04.170 --> 24:08.300
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne:  Kaitou, Surpass Space and Time!!

24:08.300 --> 24:11.550
Maron, believe in yourself.

24:11.550 --> 24:14.260
Believe in...myself?
